# Local `next dev` (pnpm dev:web) reads apps/web/.env.local. Copy this file and fill in real values.
# Optional for local dev: without it the public site renders with empty program lists.
# NOTE (Slice 0): in .env.local this must be a DEVELOPMENT database (name starting "rms_dev"), not production.
#   Seeds (--target=development) reject anything else. Tests never read this file; they use TEST_DATABASE_URL
#   (see repo-root .env.example and docs/development/testing.md).
POSTGRES_URL=""
